# ============================================================
# AGENT MEMORY / RUNTIME STATE
# ============================================================
# Anchored to root — backend/app/memory/ is the real source package (CLAUDE.md
# project structure), not runtime state; an unanchored "memory/" here was
# silently hiding it from git (and backend/app/models/ via the models/ rule
# above) rather than the intended top-level runtime-artifact directory.
/memory/
runtime/
state/
sessions/
cache/
.cache/

logs/
*.log


